  goodReduction_of_QM_rational3_of_alg hNOS hRay hTors quatUnipotentTrivial O w hw A hdim I J
    hI hJ hIJ h3 hrat

/-- **A6 without the auxiliary `w`**: the valuation subring of `K̄` over `O` exists
