section LeafFoldT2

/-!
# t-brauer-purity: Abhyankar's lemma, DVR form (leaf T2, `PkgI2.AbhyankarDVR`), proved

Contents: copies of `AbhyankarBricks.lean` and `KummerUnramified.lean` (scratch files cannot import
